{"document_id":"alpha-export-guide","knowledge_revision_id":"alpha-export-guide-r1","project_id":"project-alpha","project_version":"1.0","locale":"zh-CN","access_segment":"PUBLIC","knowledge_release_id":"alpha-release-2026-08-r1","knowledge_space_id":"alpha-public","citation_url":"https://docs.example.invalid/alpha/export","title":"导出审计日志","document_type":"faq","text":"# 导出审计日志\n\n## 如何导出\n\n在管理控制台打开审计日志，选择时间范围后点击“导出 CSV”。导出任务完成后可以下载 CSV 文件。\n\n## 权限\n\n只有项目管理员可以创建导出任务。"}
{"document_id":"alpha-api-rate-limit","knowledge_revision_id":"alpha-api-rate-limit-r1","project_id":"project-alpha","project_version":"1.0","locale":"zh-CN","access_segment":"PUBLIC","knowledge_release_id":"alpha-release-2026-08-r1","knowledge_space_id":"alpha-public","citation_url":"https://docs.example.invalid/alpha/api/rate-limits","title":"API 速率限制","document_type":"api","text":"# API 速率限制\n\n`POST /v1/events` 的默认限制是每分钟 120 次请求。超出限制时服务返回 HTTP 429，并携带 `Retry-After`。\n\n```http\nPOST /v1/events\nAuthorization: Bearer token\n```"}
{"document_id":"alpha-release-notes","knowledge_revision_id":"alpha-release-notes-r1","project_id":"project-alpha","project_version":"1.0","locale":"zh-CN","access_segment":"PUBLIC","knowledge_release_id":"alpha-release-2026-08-r1","knowledge_space_id":"alpha-public","citation_url":"https://docs.example.invalid/alpha/releases/1.0","title":"1.0 发布公告","document_type":"release_notes","text":"# 1.0 发布公告\n\n## 新功能\n\n1.0 新增审计日志导出和 API 请求配额提示。\n\n## 兼容性\n\n旧版客户端继续支持读取接口。"}
{"document_id":"alpha-policy","knowledge_revision_id":"alpha-policy-r1","project_id":"project-alpha","project_version":"1.0","locale":"zh-CN","access_segment":"PUBLIC","knowledge_release_id":"alpha-release-2026-08-r1","knowledge_space_id":"alpha-public","citation_url":"https://docs.example.invalid/alpha/policy/retention","title":"日志保留政策","document_type":"policy","text":"# 日志保留政策\n\n1. 审计日志默认保留 180 天。\n2. 管理员可以在保留期内导出日志。\n3. 删除项目后，日志按照已批准的数据删除流程清理。"}
{"document_id":"alpha-authorized","knowledge_revision_id":"alpha-authorized-r1","project_id":"project-alpha","project_version":"1.0","locale":"zh-CN","access_segment":"PROJECT_AUTHORIZED","knowledge_release_id":"alpha-release-2026-08-r1","knowledge_space_id":"alpha-restricted","citation_url":"https://docs.example.invalid/alpha/private","title":"项目授权说明","document_type":"prose","text":"项目授权用户可以查看受限的内部发布准备状态。该内容不能被匿名访客检索。"}
{"document_id":"beta-export-guide","knowledge_revision_id":"beta-export-guide-r1","project_id":"project-beta","project_version":"1.0","locale":"zh-CN","access_segment":"PUBLIC","knowledge_release_id":"beta-release-2026-08-r1","knowledge_space_id":"beta-public","citation_url":"https://docs.example.invalid/beta/export","title":"Beta 导出文件","document_type":"prose","text":"Beta 项目的导出格式是 JSON Lines，不提供 CSV 审计日志导出。"}
